Package: fcitx5-osk
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: yuzu <yuzu23234@gmail.com>
Depends: fontconfig, fcitx5 (>= 5.1.22), libc6, libgcc-s1, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libegl1, libvulkan1, libxcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxrandr2
Homepage: https://github.com/fortime/fcitx5-osk
Description: On-screen keyboard for Fcitx 5 and KWin Wayland
 Includes native input-panel integration, the KWin launcher and modifier-key
 helper. Optional HTTP custom actions are disabled.
